OL,5,G0105 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FSludge and the Phantom ride into
OL,7,     Fbattle fighting the elements. An
OL,8,     Fold river boat nearly scuttles two
OL,9,     Ftruckers along the bumpy road to
OL,10,     Frestoration.
OL,11,G0205 Trucking Hell
OL,12,     FJim and his team face a tricky
OL,13,     Ftask when two artics crash on the
OL,14,     Ffoggy M1 causing five-mile-long
OL,15,     Ftailback.
OL,16,G0305 Trucking Hell
OL,17,     FFollowing those who take on
OL,18,     Fsuper-sized transport jobs. Steve
OL,19,     Fand the team find themselves in
OL,20,     Fdeep water when they attempt to
OL,21,     Frecover a crashed car from a
OL,22,     Friver.
